==================================

ENTRY RESULT FROM v0.5
----------------------
Largest externally bounded tau charge-radius benchmark:
  <r_nu_tau^2> = -2.0e-31 cm^2

User's v0.5 output:
  current IceCube profiled Z = 0.08984
